  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Establishing an Environment for AI-based Legal Service and Korea-Uzbekistan Law Center</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim is to integrate digital and AI technologies into existing legal services to expand services and enhance professional expertise, create an environment where legal information such as laws and case precedents from advanced countries like Korea can be searched to improve information accessibility, and foster international law and Korean law experts through legal research exchange with Korea.AI &#xae30;&#xbc18; &#xb300;&#xad6d;&#xbbfc; &#xbc95;&#xb960;&#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xd655;&#xb300;, &#xb514;&#xc9c0;&#xd138; &#xc804;&#xd658;&#xc5d0; &#xc694;&#xad6c;&#xb418;&#xb294; &#xbc95;&#xd559;&#xad50;&#xc721; &#xbc0f; &#xc5f0;&#xad6c;&#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xd655;&#xbcf4;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal is to promote Uzbekistan&apos;s digital transformation and development through the establishment of a Digital Legal Capacity Strengthening Master Plan, the creation of an integrated AI-based legal service platform and digital legal library, enhancement of digital transition capabilities, training of Korean law experts, and the provision of ICT equipment.</narrative>
  </description>
